  "implemented": [
    "Replaced regular wall lines with deterministic crease-following, tapered and branching fissures, plus 10-40cm short cracks.",
    "Distinct sparse, medium and dense variants; sparse variants use only two small cracks per visible side.",
    "Lower half denser; gate frames, cave and volcano cones receive the same irregular treatment. Cone rivers bend and branch.",
    "Restored cold rock where the old 005 veins had been; no new wall-foot orange ambient bake.",
    "Copied all 26 source FBX byte-for-byte, including UVs, pivots, dimensions, file names, child names and triangle counts.",
    "Preserved flow UV band and decoded pixels, UV direction, scroll rules, ground maps, door seal and crater pools.",
    "Supplied native Unity player view at the 005 camera, v2/v3 comparison, close-up and eight category sheets."
  ],
