  "interpretations": [
    "The requested 5-9% glow is the physical-area-weighted total across ordinary wall variants. Individual nearly empty variants are intentionally below 5%, and dense variants can be above 9%, so the requested variant contrast remains visible. See every object fraction in inspect.json.",
    "Angles are measured from local projected surface vertical in metre-scale H/Y charts, both by segment count and total length. The unchanged flow sheets, geometric door seal and crater pools are not vein segments."
  ],
